        <!-- VERSION 3.5.0 - THE MEGA UPDATE -->
        <div class="version-block">
            <div class="version-header">
                <div class="version-number">v3.5.0 - The Growth & Stability Update</div>
                <div class="version-date">June 2024</div>
            </div>
            
            <h3><span class="tag tag-new">New</span> Social Features</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Refer a Friend System:</strong> Introduced an invite-based reward system. Share your unique Invite Code to earn massive bonuses.</li>
                <li><strong>Recruitment Rewards:</strong> New players receive **3,000¢** instantly. Referrers receive a **3X Credit Chest** when their friend reaches Sector 16.</li>
                <li><strong>Community Promo Codes:</strong> The Codex now supports global promo codes. Use code **VOID2026** for a special gift!</li>
            </ul>

            <h3><span class="tag tag-opt">Stability & Performance</span></h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>ANR Protection:</strong> Implemented "Freeze-Proof" triple-layer protection to prevent Android's "Application Not Responding" errors during intense late-game waves.</li>
                <li><strong>Multithreaded Cloud Saving:</strong> All Google Play Games operations (Saving, Leaderboards, Achievements) now run on background threads with a 5s safety timeout.</li>
                <li><strong>Engine Optimization:</strong> Migrated to squared-distance collision logic, reducing CPU calculations by nearly 40% during bullet-heavy sequences.</li>
                <li><strong>Galaxy S25 Support:</strong> Fixed UI layout issues to ensure perfect scaling on modern narrow-screen devices.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3><span class="tag tag-new">Game Logic & Scaling</span></h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Infinite Progression:</strong> Internal number limit increased to **1e100** (Google-Go!). Numbers will no longer hit a "ceiling" in the deepest parts of the Void.</li>
                <li><strong>Advanced Session Metrics:</strong> Station Lost summary now displays "Session Time" and "Credits Per Minute" for better optimization.</li>
                <li><strong>Singularity Logic Fix:</strong> Resolved a critical bug where high-tier run stats could occasionally default back to Tier 1.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

